 least three queries.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-30-3. Rank candidates with SHA-256 using seed `20260711`.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-31-4. Select one repository per eligible language before filling remaining slots,\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-32-   for eight repositories total.\n--\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-35-   the smoke run.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-36-\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-37-The selection freezer records the complete candidate catalog, every source\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-38-hash, exact base commits, query hashes, candidate-set hashes, and qrel hashes.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md:39:It never invokes Entire, CBM, file search, BM25, or an LLM.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-40-\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md:41:CORE-Bench can contain duplicate rows for one `(query_id, corpus_id)` pair.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-42-Native retrieval scoring therefore uses unique corpus IDs while retaining and\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-43-hashing the raw qrel rows. Corpus documents contain text but no path, and the\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-44-same text can occur in generated and source files. Native chunk scoring accepts\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-45-one or more exact tracked locations for a corpus ID; file-level diagnostics use\n--\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-119-generic host-path pattern. CI runs it on every push\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-120-(`tests/test_core_redaction.py` plus a direct `verify` step), so an\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-121-unsanitized artifact cannot land.\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md-122-\n/private/tmp/brain-bench-graph-agentic-pilot/competitive-eval/core-bench/README.md:123:Fresh Entire Graph outputs are not publication-authorized until a separate\n"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
