{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:33:25.322Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"The product audit found six real defects that would undermine the proof—not benchmark excuses: an order-unsafe cache key, unbounded ambiguous neighbor output, mislabeled/missing latency, a context-budget exception, hidden partial failures, and missing capability advertisement. I’m fixing these in parallel before freezing any evaluation head.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
