{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:34:22.426Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_message","message":"I’m treating every audit finding as a product defect to close, not as an excuse for the benchmark result. I’m splitting the fixes by file ownership now, then I’ll integrate, run the full Graph checks, push a checkpoint, and tighten the unpaid benchmark/preregistration around the corrected product head.","phase":"commentary","memory_citation":null}}
