{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:40:56.515Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_019f75e3-4542-7f20-a1f9-c289a60174cf","author":"/root/neighbors_product_fix","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/neighbors_product_fix\nPayload:\nImplemented the focused-neighbors fixes in:\n\n- `internal/cli/neighbors.go`\n- `internal/cli/neighbors_efficiency_test.go`\n\nDelivered:\n\n- Separate index-load, query, and total latency telemetry in JSON and agent output.\n- Deterministic `--limit` bounding of ambiguous focus matches by file, line, then stable ID.\n- Single-pass adjacency construction instead of rescanning relations per focus.\n- Machine-readable provider `partial_failures`, `stats`, and `completeness`.\n- Concise agent warnings for incomplete coverage.\n- Regression coverage for telemetry, ambiguity limiting, adjacency, parse errors, and unsupported languages.\n\nVerification passed:\n\n```text\ngo test ./internal/cli\ngo test ./internal/cli -run 'Test(Neighbors|AgentNeighbors|ConventionalTestPath)' -count=1\n```\n\nNo commit or push performed."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
