{"timestamp":"2026-07-18T15:48:03.732Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","id":"fco_019f75e9-ca14-7103-94c4-a0e93fe2f6ea","call_id":"call_JtjOjNnPrtrVBINCchU3tRXB","output":"{\"agents\":[{\"agent_name\":\"/root\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/cache_order_fix\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"One actionable finding:\\n\\n- [P2] [internal/cli/search.go:144](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/internal/cli/search.go:144): expanded telemetry consumes the agent result budget before ranked output. With an intermediate budget such as 64 bytes, the old format could emit the cache line plus a top-ranked location; the new 67+ byte header is instead truncated at line 168, yielding incomplete telemetry, no newline, and no result. The 20-byte regression at [internal/cli/root_test.go:351](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/internal/cli/root_test.go:351) verifies only the hard cap and misses this usefulness/compatibility regression. Use compact/fallback telemetry under tight budgets or otherwise preserve at least one ranked location where the legacy format could.\\n\\nNo other actionable findings in the search/index/provider/neighbors changes. Full `internal/cli` and `internal/sem` tests pass under the mise-managed toolchain; `git diff --check` passes. No files were edited.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/cache_order_fix/cli_diff_review\",\"agent_status\":{\"completed\":\"- [P2] Expanded telemetry can consume the entire agent result budget — [internal/cli/search.go:144](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/internal/cli/search.go:144). The old cache line was about 24 bytes; the new line is 67+ bytes and is subtracted before formatting results, then sliced at line 168. Thus a previously useful budget such as 64 now emits only a truncated diagnostic (`... | T`) and no ranked result. This is also a backward-incompatible change to the documented first line. Preserve the original cache line and make extra telemetry conditional, or prioritize at least one result before optional telemetry. The 20-byte test at [internal/cli/root_test.go:351](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-graph/internal/cli/root_test.go:351) misses this intermediate-budget regression.\\n\\nNo actionable index/JSON findings. Focused and full `internal/cli` tests pass with the repository’s mise-managed Go toolchain.\"}},{\"agent_name\":\"/root/neighbors_review\",\"agent_status\":\"running\"}]}","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"5dfd74e8-4c67-4fb7-a4c3-45f47a5e848d"}}}
